WEBVTT

00:21:58.141 --> 00:22:00.979
And it was that moment,
it was 4:30 on a Friday, March 6.

00:22:01.003 --> 00:22:04.286
I knew that we were in for something else.

00:22:04.310 --> 00:22:05.886
AG: Meet Charles Hill.

00:22:05.910 --> 00:22:08.244
He's the General Manager
of DoubleTree by Hilton

00:22:08.268 --> 00:22:11.946
in Crystal City, Virginia,
just outside Washington, DC.

00:22:11.970 --> 00:22:15.706
That Friday, his hotel was hit
with a wave of cancellations.

00:22:15.730 --> 00:22:19.461
As the reality of how severely
the coronavirus would affect them set in,

00:22:19.485 --> 00:22:23.266
he was called into nonstop meetings
to answer an impossible question:

00:22:23.290 --> 00:22:26.446
How do you manage a hotel
in the middle of a pandemic?

00:22:26.470 --> 00:22:28.505
CH: What is it that's happening around us?

00:22:28.529 --> 00:22:32.640
How big is this?
And what do we need to do?